{"suttaId":"tha-ap94","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4966,4984],"vripara":"8"},"segments":{"tha-ap94:0.3":"Sucintikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap94:1.1":"“Tissassa lokanāthassa, suddhapīṭhamadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap94:1.3":"Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena, buddhassādiccabandhuno.","tha-ap94:2.1":"“Aṭṭhārase [aṭṭhatiṃse (sī. syā.)] ito kappe, rājā āsiṃ mahāruci;","tha-ap94:2.3":"Bhogo ca vipulo āsi, sayanañca anappakaṃ.","tha-ap94:3.1":"“Pīṭhaṃ buddhassa datvāna, vippasannena cetasā;","tha-ap94:3.3":"Anubhomi sakaṃ kammaṃ, pubbe sukatamattano.","tha-ap94:4.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, yaṃ pīṭhamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap94:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pīṭhadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap94:5.1":"“Aṭṭhatiṃse ito kappe, tayo te cakkavattino;","tha-ap94:5.3":"Ruci uparuci ceva, mahāruci tatiyako.","tha-ap94:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap94:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sucintiko thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap94:8.1":"Sucintikattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2762,"to":2762,"paras":[{"para":2762,"vripara":"8","refs":["tha-ap94:1"],"words":["tissassa lokanāthassā"],"lines":["So pattaarahattaphalo pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>tissassa lokanāthassā</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap94:1"],["tha-ap94:1"]]}]},"tika":null}
